IRIX MIPS codegen and bootstrap adjustments

mips.cc: make IRIX's va_list a plain char *, do not emit the .mdebug.abi
section that the native ld warns about, emit the o32 .globl name .text
directive for undefined functions so the linker cannot skip necessary
$gp setup, keep common objects non-local for the native ld, guard
ASM_OUTPUT_TYPE_DIRECTIVE, and mark o32 functions written so
mips_file_end does not treat them as external. The R4000 fp_add cost
change is the pdaxrom tuning tweak.

dwarf2cfi.cc: save the return-address register into
DWARF_FRAME_RETURN_COLUMN when the IRIX layout moves it, which the
IRIX 6 host bootstrap needs. varasm.cc relaxes two assertions that IRIX
assembly paths trip.

Provenance: pdaxrom/irix-gcc tag 1.2 (2aa3421b), gcc-15.2.0-irix.diff.
All hunks applied to 16.2 with offsets only; no re-derivation was needed.

diff --git a/gcc/config/mips/mips.cc b/gcc/config/mips/mips.cc
